  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 228bc2d188796254eaf5d16bf8091d9f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPCInteraction
  esIntroAutomatica: 0
  teclaEPrompt: {fileID: 987895642}
  panelDialogo: {fileID: 196525227}
  textoDialogo: {fileID: 355488973}
  lineasDelDialogo:
  - Look who finally decided to wake up! Were you expecting me to bring you breakfast
    in bed or what?
  - 'We''ve reached the semifinals of this tournament; it''s no time to slack off

'
  - WHAT?? DO WE HAVE TO GO OVER THE BASICS AGAIN???
  - I guess it never hurts to review the basics, after all
  - Use C to use your powerful right hand to land a hit on the bag
  - Remember, you can't just throw punches wildly; you have about 3 seconds of rest
    between each hit
  - You can also block with V to take absolutely no damage
  - If you perform a block, your enemy will be stunned, making it the perfect opportunity
    for a counterattack
  - We can't practice blocking with the bag for obvious reasons...
  - Let's put what we know into practice. When you're ready, head right and we'll
    go to the tournament semifinals
  velocidadEscritura: 0.05
  sonidoInicio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2ca64b0d02dfcc645aa8a7a9a861c510, type: 3}
  sonidosVoz:
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: be91fc8afadfd564bbbdd53f88daffd8, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4f761c6472a56e6439ee7ccf2481afb6, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 355b010e4cc41a94eafb62ef87fb9363, type: 3}
